id: pm-8nzivt
title: "Skills over MCP: discoverable version-coherent pm workflows with progressive disclosure, capability requirements, and token budgets"
description: "Expose canonical pm skills through negotiated MCP extension contracts so agents can discover only the workflow guidance relevant to their role, surface, version, and current context budget."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[6]: agent-guidance,"area:mcp",progressive-disclosure,skills,token-budget,version-coherence
created_at: "2026-08-25T05:11:35.408Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-26T16:57:27.570Z"
deadline: "2027-01-31T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-26T16:57:27.050Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-26T16:57:27.050Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 600
acceptance_criteria: "Agents can list and fetch pm skills through a negotiated extension without loading unrelated bodies; Skill versions declare compatible pm, MCP, SDK, package, and contract versions and fail closed on drift; All CLI, SDK, MCP, package, testing, release, governance, and operator families have canonical skill routing or an explicit non-skill disposition; Examples and recovery commands are generated or validated against live runtime contracts in local and hosted CI; Token cost, completion success, stale guidance, and recovery closure are measured and ratcheted"
goal: Self-describing pm workflows over MCP
objective: Publish skills as structured versioned capabilities tied to runtime contracts instead of static duplicated prose
value: Agents receive complete current guidance without loading every pm command or maintaining harness-specific copies
why_now: The latest MCP ecosystem identifies Skills over MCP as an extension while the pm roadmap already requires all skills to cover CLI and SDK features through progressive disclosure
parent: pm-rs9vry
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Delivered negotiated Skills over MCP discovery and reads through the public SDK with provenance, pagination, digest, trust, and eager resource ceilings."
expected_result: Agents progressively discover version-coherent pm workflows without loading unrelated guidance or crossing bounded resource limits.
actual_result: "Four canonical skills are discoverable through the exact SEP draft capability; recursive reads, opaque pagination, workspace precedence, digests, trust metadata, and eager origin/file/byte limits pass packed npx/bunx and exact coverage."
